    "   \"id\": \"2d8a4e0d\",\n",
    "   \"metadata\": {},\n",
    "   \"source\": [\n",
    "    \"**Interpretation:** If mean/median bias factor is clearly above 1.0, the old denominator systematically inflates rates.\\n\",\n",
    "    \"This confirms that rare slots are overestimated when only days-with-arrivals are counted.\"\n",
    "   ]\n",
